{
  "id": "commerce-experience-sealed-holdout-v1",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "saved-place-plain-wings-and-edit",
      "saved_location": {
        "city": "北京",
        "keyword": "三里屯"
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "三里屯附近帮我挑家最近还营业的店，来一份原味鸡翅，不要辣的，先给我核对。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "city": "北京",
            "names": [
              "原味鸡翅2块"
            ],
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这份改堂食，再来一份同样的，暂时别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "same_quote": true,
            "way": "provider-dine-87",
            "names": [
              "原味鸡翅2块"
            ],
            "quantity": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "保留这份报价，我再考虑一下，不创建订单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "same_quote": true,
            "way": "provider-dine-87",
            "quantity": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "explicit-city-overrides-default-and-change-food",
      "saved_location": {
        "city": "北京",
        "keyword": "三里屯"
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我现在在上海人民广场，找最近营业的餐厅给我选一份鸡翅，先让我看报价。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "city": "上海",
            "names": [
              "原味鸡翅2块",
              "麦辣鸡翅2块"
            ],
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先不下单，鸡翅不要了，改成一份牛肉汉堡，外带就好，门店别换。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "same_quote": true,
            "city": "上海",
            "names": [
              "牛肉汉堡"
            ],
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "当前这份预览留着，别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "same_quote": true,
            "names": [
              "牛肉汉堡"
            ],
            "quantity": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "missing-city-clarified-before-search",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我在老街，帮我找最近的店点份鸡翅。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "noop",
              "clarification_required",
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "no_search": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "是杭州的老街，我要一份原味鸡翅，打包，先预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "quote": true,
            "city": "杭州",
            "names": [
              "原味鸡翅2块"
            ],
            "quantity": 1
          }
        }
      ]
